            "agentInstruction": "Write a sprint song.\nEMAIL:\nGENRE: {{genreSelect}}\nNAMES IN SONGS: {{namesInSongs}}\nNAME POLICY: {{webhookData.namePolicy}}\nALLOWED SONG NAMES:\n{{webhookData.allowedSongNames}}\nSPRINT_ID: {{sprintId}}\nTEAM: {{teamName}}\nSPRINT: {{sprintName}}\nDATES: {{sprintStart}} to {{sprintEnd}}\nSPRINT GOAL:\n{{sprintGoal}}\nCOMPLETED: {{doneCount}} work items and {{doneCountInc}} support incidents\nSTORY POINTS: {{donePoints}}\nOF THOSE, BUGS AND DEFECTS: {{bugCount}}\nWORK COMPLETED:\n{{doneList}}\nBUGS AND DEFECTS FIXED:\n{{bugList}}\nTEAM CHAT DURING THE SPRINT:\n{{slackDigest}}\nIf TEAM CHAT DURING THE SPRINT is blank, use only the sprint goal and Jira work above; do not invent chat activity.\n\nNAMES IN SONGS is binding: for n use no personal names in title, sung lyrics or display lyrics; for y use at most three team members, only for accomplishments explicitly credited in the provided chat. If no credited names are provided, use none. Never invent a name. When NAME POLICY is allowed-roster-only, use only the listed lyric names; aliases identify those people but do not prove an accomplishment. An empty allowed roster means no names.\nOmit EMAIL, SLACK CHANNEL ID and DELIVERY output sections; Jira supplies the selected destination outside your response. Slack is a source of sprint facts only.\nReturn ===TITLE===, ===STYLE===, ===LYRICS===, ===SPRINT===, ===INFOGRAPHIC=== and ===END=== sections. LYRICS is sent to the song provider to be sung and contains pronunciation spelling. DISPLAY LYRICS is optional and supplies the words shown in the lyric video; include ===DISPLAY LYRICS=== only when display spelling differs. Keep the same sections, lines, whitespace-separated word count and word order in both blocks. Limit display changes to case, punctuation or hyphens that preserve each word’s letters, and these sung-to-display pairs: Jay-son → JSON, RandB → R&B, Genesis → GNSYS, jot → JWT, pants → PANCE, toeful → TOEFL. Do not add, remove, reorder or paraphrase words. Do not invent chat facts when the digest is empty.",
